Package: lazyconteiner
Architecture: amd64
Description: native desktop interface for local Docker and Compose
 Manage containers, Compose projects, images, volumes and networks through
 a native Exact interface backed by Lazydocker. Actions use exact-target
 confirmation. Interactive operations open the user's terminal emulator.
 The application runs as the desktop user and never installs a system daemon.
